nd bundling heuristics were not evaluated.","evidence":[{"kind":"rpc","label":"covered to block","source":"rpc","value":"35322499"}],"flag":"INSUFFICIENT_DATA","points":0,"severity":"medium","title":"Early-buyer window not read"},{"affects":["holder","insider"],"category":"meta","code":"EVM_HOLDERS_UNAVAILABLE","confidence":1,"detail":"Holder concentration is reconstructed by folding every Transfer log into balances, and the token has more history than tier \"basic\" is budgeted to read. A partial fold is not reported, because a holder whose only incoming transfer fell outside the range would disappear and make the remaining holders look larger than they are. The absence of a concentration flag here means nothing was measured, not that the distribution is healthy.","evidence":[{"kind":"rpc","label":"method","source":"rpc","value":"eth_getLogs fold"},{"kind":"rpc","label":"reason","source":"derived","value":"budget-exhausted"}],"flag":"INSUFFICIENT_DATA","points":0,"severity":"medium","title":"Holder distribution unavailable"},{"affects":["liquidity"],"category":"meta","code":"EVM_LIQUIDITY_WINDOW_PARTIAL","confidence":1,"detail":"The pools found hold less than this chain’s threshold, but the blocks searched do not cover the whole life of this token, so a pool created earlier would not have been seen — and a launchpad’s graduation pool is usually the oldest. The depth that was read is not compared with the threshold.","evidence":[{"kind":"derived","label":"approximate quote depth in ETH, native pools and priced pools","source":"derived","value":"0.0000 ETH"},{"kind":"derived","label":"pools not priced","source":"derived","value":"12"},{"kind":"pool","label":"uniswap-v4 fee 8388608","source":"rpc","value":"0x005d63361d7cfa14dd24fa82444536b8f472b2b6005ade17a036c20418507fd0 paired with 0x39452E29875778AEC02619F28717d07867d51E18, depth not priced"},{"kind":"pool","label":"uniswap-v4 fee 8388608","source":"rpc","value":"0x46de445f752cc15d07de3050936647709492194f76b8118fb6